{
  "source": "Fux, The Study of Counterpoint (trans. Mann, 1965), p. 33, Fig. 8: an octave into a fifth in direct motion, descending and ascending",
  "transcription": "Sounding pitches as MIDI numbers, durations in beats. Each pair: whole notes (figures 8 5), then the leap filled in with quarter notes, which shows two fifths in a row (figures 5 5).",
  "system": { "type": "edo", "divisions": 12, "mode": [0, 2, 4, 5, 7, 9, 11] },
